# Admin panel (/api/admin-panel, read-only) — two doors, either works:
#  · ADMIN_PANEL_KEY: static passphrase the founders type ONCE into the
#    panel's login card; POST /session trades it (captcha + per-IP failure
#    limit) for a 2h scope-limited token that rides every call.
#  · ADMIN_EMAILS: allowlist of founder emails for logged-in callers,
#    comma-separated, case-insensitive (the future default door).
# With BOTH unset the panel 404s outright.
ADMIN_PANEL_KEY=
ADMIN_EMAILS=

# Legacy product gate — FAIL-CLOSED (founder 2026-07-26):
#  · LEGACY_ENABLED: global true/false switch. 'true' ⇒ the Personal↔Legacy
#    toggle is visible to everyone (the allowlist is irrelevant). Anything
#    else — 'false', unset, a typo — ⇒ Legacy is OFF for everyone…
#  · …except LEGACY_ACCESS_EMAILS: with the switch off, ONLY these account
#    emails keep the toggle (comma-separated, case-insensitive). Off + empty
#    list ⇒ nobody sees it. Own list on purpose: the admin panel and the
#    Legacy product are different powers. Visibility only — governed-account
#    APIs keep their own server-side auth.
LEGACY_ENABLED=
LEGACY_ACCESS_EMAILS=

# Beta gate — FAIL-CLOSED (founder 2026-08-01, beta opens 08-06):
#  · BETA_REGISTRATION_OPEN: 'true' ⇒ anyone can create an account. Anything
#    else — 'false', unset, a typo — ⇒ CLOSED: only waitlist emails a founder
#    approved (admin panel → Waitlist → Approve) can register. Guards account
#    CREATION on every path (email, OAuth, wallet-first); login is untouched.
BETA_REGISTRATION_OPEN=

# ============================================================================
# ANTI-BOT (Cloudflare Turnstile) — 2026-07-23 hardening
# ============================================================================
# Server-side settlement of the captcha token every credential-bearing POST
# carries (login, register, forgot-password, waitlist, admin session). Unset →
# the check is OFF (local dev / tests need no network). The matching sitekey
# lives in the frontend as NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY (public by design).
# Dev pair that always passes: sitekey 1x00000000000000000000AA / secret
# 1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA. Real keys: dash.cloudflare.com → Turnstile.
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=

